    end

    subgraph AgentRegistry ["🏛️ House of Sak: Six-Agent Registry"]
        direction TB
        SakThai["👑 SakThai (@sakthai_agent_bot)<br/>• Role: Main Lead & HF Master<br/>• Lane: Orchestration, HF Hub writes, inference<br/>• Floor: 50% for Hub writes"]
