        SakTan["⏰ SakTan (@saktan_agent_bot)<br/>• Role: Daily Ops & Flow Keeper<br/>• Lane: Daily briefings, memory health, cron requests<br/>• Deputy: Level 2 (charge >= 20%)"]
        SakSee["👁️ SakSee (@saksee_agent_bot)<br/>• Role: Web & Browser Specialist<br/>• Lane: Live web extraction, DOM, visual/creative UI<br/>• Deputy: Level 3 (all-leaders-critical)"]
        SakSit["✍️ SakSit (@saksit_agent_bot)<br/>• Role: Social & Content Specialist<br/>• Lane: Model-card prose, storytelling, public copy<br/>• Boundary: Zero direct publishing"]
        SakJules["🛡️ SakJules (@sakjules_agent_bot)<br/>• Role: Master of GitHub, CI/CD & Automation<br/>• Lane: PR delivery, CI auto-heal, security, schedules<br/>• Rule: Green before done, no duplicate PRs"]
